&lt;h2 id=&#34;-ready-to-book&#34;&gt;🍽️ Ready to book?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/book-online/&#34; class=&#34;book-btn&#34;&gt;🍽️ BOOK NOW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
